Treat the device as an international build

The camera takes "international build" from ro.product.mod_device ending in _global. A Chinese
build routes the first-start privacy and permission consent through HyperOS' Security Center,
which this system does not have, and never gets past it; an international build uses Android's
own permission requests. The flag is set here because other apps read ro.product.mod_device.

